times: World event: watch_founded (sphere prot). A watch is raised: the council pays for local officers on foot; about 3 in 10 people on the estates they walk meet them as a moment of their own (share .3, estimate)
likelier: an estate with thefts and fights, a council with money, trust in the rule
rarer: a quiet suburb, a place that distrusts the police
gap: 10-30
tone: joy
life: community, work
horizon: months
roles: neighbours, friend, parent
