scene: The council has paid for a team of local officers to walk the estate on foot. On the first morning one of them stops at {Ns} door, says her name, and asks what the street worries about most.
scene W: {N} has waited years for someone in uniform to treat the estate the same as the smart side of town.
scene U: {N} could tell her exactly which corners and which hours, if she really wants to know.
