- WU | help the team write down the estate's worries, block by block | v: universalism, security | sphere: prot.WU | chance: 66
works: Within a year the officers know every family, and {N} knows them.
works: The estate feels safer at night, and {Ns} street is talked about for the right reasons.
fails: The money runs out after eighteen months, and the officers go back to their cars.
