earth: on the late bus a man starts shouting and shoving at the driver's door, and someone has to do something
scene: On the late bus home a man starts shouting at the driver, then shoving at the little door of her cab. She holds it shut with one hand. There are twelve passengers, and every one of them is looking at the floor.
scene W: There is a right thing to do here, and everyone on the bus knows it. {N} waits to see if anyone does it.
scene U: {N} notes the stop, the time, the man's coat, and where the alarm button is.
scene B: {N} is big enough to matter here, and knows it. The only question is whether it is {Ns} business.
scene R: {Ns} heart is going like a drum, and {Ns} legs are already moving.
scene G: The old man beside {N} is shaking. These are {Ns} people tonight, whoever they are.
